		'The Caxton Celebration: William Caxton showing specimens of printing to King Edward IV and his Queen' => 'Die Caxton-Feier: William Caxton zeigt König Eduard IV. und seiner Königin Druckproben',
		'The Caxton Celebration (1877): William Caxton showing specimens of his printing to King Edward IV and his Queen. Image: William Small, The Graphic, 1877, public domain, via Wikimedia Commons.' => 'Die Caxton-Feier (1877): William Caxton zeigt König Eduard IV. und seiner Königin Druckproben. Bild: William Small, The Graphic, 1877, gemeinfrei, via Wikimedia Commons.',
